o/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Action based 2D platform gameplay;<br></li><li>9 Levels full of combats and action puzzles, each one with an epic bossfight;<br></li><li>Friendly and accessible gameplay and controls;<br></li><li>Vibrant synthwave music and pixel art visuals;<br></li><li>5 hours of gameplay, counting secrets and collectible.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229500/extras/97502be0fce4e1f28ad6601a8159f3ec.poster.avif?t=1750251579\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1229500/extras/97502be0fce4e1f28ad6601a8159f3ec.apng?t=1750251579\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
